<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Sipef more than doubles H1 96 net.</title>
<headline>Belgian Sipef more than doubles H1 96 net.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons group net profit		   160	vs     74</p>
<p>    Cons extraordinary profit/loss	 40 loss vs	2</p>
<p>    Cons current profit		     320	vs    225</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit		   330	vs    322</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales (blns)	  1.710	vs  1.848</p>
<p>    Cash flow				   233	vs    138</p>
<p>NOTE - Sipef NV is a Belgian agricultural holding company.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
